  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">U.S. Department of State: Nonproliferation Assistance Programs - Combating Weapons of Mass Destruction Terrorism (WMDT), Counter Nuclear Smuggling Program (CNSP) - Celestar</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WMDT-CNSP will utilize Celestar to help achieve its mission of enhancing partner country capabilities to prevent, detect, and respond to incidents of nuclear and other radioactive material smuggling. The contract provides technical, analytical, and project management support to WMDT-CNSP. Contractors will perform country assessments to target WMDT-CNSP assistance to the highest priority CNS gaps and vulnerabilities, ensuring programmatic support is consistent with the goals and objectives in the CNS Joint Action Plan and is coordinated with the partner country and those of other U.S.and international assistance providers. Contractors will also develop project proposals and provide administrative and project management support to implement those projects.</narrative>
  </description>
